 [[sym-tares]]Tares (darnel):: The counterfeit sown among the sym:sym-wheat[wheat] by the enemy — a weed that mimics the true grain until the harvest, then is bound in bundles and burned; the children of the wicked one, distinct from the winnowed sym:sym-chaff[chaff]. +
